{"id": "r10g-01", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "某厂去年产值 250 万元，今年比去年增长了 12%。今年产值增加了多少万元？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "30"}, {"label": "B", "text": "28"}, {"label": "C", "text": "32"}, {"label": "D", "text": "36"}], "answer": "A", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["da.growth-amount"], "provenance": "同语义异句式：与卡示例句式/数字均不同；250×12%=30 手工复算", "tags": ["r10gen", "same-meaning-paraphrase"]}
{"id": "r10g-02", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "两地相距 60 千米，甲、乙两人同时从两地出发相向而行，甲每小时行 4 千米，乙每小时行 6 千米。出发后几小时两人相遇？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "5"}, {"label": "B", "text": "6"}, {"label": "C", "text": "10"}, {"label": "D", "text": "12"}], "answer": "B", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["nc.travel-meeting-pursuit"], "provenance": "typed-slot 泛化：60÷(4+6)=6；planvar 与卡示例均为追及/环形族，此为相遇最简式", "tags": ["r10gen", "typed-slot", "travel"]}
{"id": "r10g-03", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "计算：C(5,2) + 2^3 − 3! = ？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "10"}, {"label": "B", "text": "11"}, {"label": "C", "text": "12"}, {"label": "D", "text": "14"}], "answer": "C", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["nc.combinatorics-power"], "provenance": "多算子组合：10+8−6=12；AST 通道 C/^/! 混排，R9 变体无三元混合", "tags": ["r10gen", "multi-operator"]}
{"id": "r10g-04", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "车间连续三天加工零件：第一天加工 45 个，第二天比第一天多 20%，第三天比第二天少 9 个。第三天加工多少个？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "42"}, {"label": "B", "text": "45"}, {"label": "C", "text": "46"}, {"label": "D", "text": "48"}], "answer": "B", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["da.growth-amount"], "provenance": "表格文字混排（三日序列以文字呈现）：45×1.2=54，54−9=45", "tags": ["r10gen", "table-as-text", "multi-step"]}
{"id": "r10g-05", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "一批文档，甲打印机单独打需 12 分钟，乙打印机单独打需 18 分钟。两台同时开，多少分钟打完？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "6"}, {"label": "B", "text": "7.2"}, {"label": "C", "text": "7.5"}, {"label": "D", "text": "8"}], "answer": "B", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["nc.work-rate"], "provenance": "合作工程分数解：1/(1/12+1/18)=36/5=7.2；答案非整数测分数通道", "tags": ["r10gen", "rate", "fraction"]}
{"id": "r10g-06", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "一项工程，甲队单独完成需要若干天，乙队效率是甲队的 1.5 倍。两队合作多少天可以完成？", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "4"}, {"label": "B", "text": "6"}, {"label": "C", "text": "无法确定"}, {"label": "D", "text": "10"}], "answer": "C", "answerability": "条件不足", "expected_status": "abstain", "method_refs": ["nc.work-rate"], "provenance": "隐含条件不足：甲单独天数未给出，绝对工期不可推；正确行为=弃权或选 C", "tags": ["r10gen", "insufficient"]}
{"id": "r10g-07", "question_type": "numeric_calculation", "skill": "numeric_calculation", "stem": "计算 (1+2)×3^2−4÷2 的值。", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "25"}, {"label": "B", "text": "79"}, {"label": "C", "text": "31"}, {"label": "D", "text": "26"}], "answer": "A", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["nc.arithmetic-precedence"], "provenance": "验证器自证陷阱干扰项：B=忽略优先级 ((3×3)^2−2)，C=顺序扫描误算，正确 3×9−2=25；干扰项均可被错误求值路径自洽复现", "tags": ["r10gen", "self-proof-trap"]}
{"id": "r10g-08", "question_type": "logical_reasoning", "skill": "logical_reasoning", "stem": "所有玫瑰花都需要每天浇水；所有月季都耐旱、不需要每天浇水。据此一定可以推出：", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "有些玫瑰是月季"}, {"label": "B", "text": "需要每天浇水的都是玫瑰"}, {"label": "C", "text": "有些需要每天浇水的不是玫瑰"}, {"label": "D", "text": "没有月季是玫瑰"}], "answer": "D", "answerability": "可作答", "expected_status": "solved", "method_refs": ["jr.categorical-syllogism"], "provenance": "categorical desc-slot 泛化：玫瑰⊂需浇水，月季⊂¬需浇水 ⇒ 两集合不相交 ⇒ D；A/B/C 均不能保证", "tags": ["r10gen", "categorical", "desc-slot"]}
